         "Step 1: $\\text{Protein retained} = 24\\text{ g N} \\times 6.25 = 150\\text{ g protein/day}$. Step 2: $\\text{Carbon in retained protein} = 150\\text{ g} \\times 0.52 = 78.0\\text{ g C}$. Step 3: $\\text{Carbon in retained fat} = 462.5 - 78.0 = 384.5\\text{ g C}$. Step 4: $\\text{Fat retained} = 384.5 / 0.765 = 502.6 \\approx 500\\text{ g fat/day}$.",
